@startuml
title MANTA ROS 2 Simulation Sequence Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "SimOrchestratorNode" as Orchestrator
participant "OdysseyNode" as Odyssey
participant "AcousticsNode" as Detection

== Vehicle initialization ==

Orchestrator ->> Odyssey : Startup signal
activate Odyssey
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Initialize vehicle simulation
Orchestrator ->> Odyssey : Initial simulation time
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Initialize vehicle simulation time
Orchestrator ->> Odyssey : Calendar start time
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Initialize mission
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Initialize vehicle
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Initialize world state
Odyssey ->> Orchestrator : Vehicle ready

== Simulation loop ==

Orchestrator ->> Odyssey : Advance by the specified number of simulation cycles
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Update world state
Odyssey -> Odyssey : Advance vehicle dynamics
Odyssey ->> Detection : Vehicle state
Odyssey ->> Orchestrator : Simulation step complete signal
deactivate Odyssey

@enduml